{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：15:14 2026-09-28 HKT<br/>發佈時間：15:14 2026-09-28 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：15:14 2026-09-28 HKT</p><p>為慶祝成團八周年，MIRROR將12月舉行演唱會，12子今日（28日）到沙田出席演唱會記者會公布演唱會詳情，吸引過千鏡粉帶同應援物到場，迫爆兩層商場，當中以盧瀚霆（AL）及姜濤的粉絲最多。</p><img alt=\"MIRROR為慶祝成團八周年，將12月舉行演唱會。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/d75f72d2e9d047fd56c877f2c1404044/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-28_at_2_45_00_PM.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"12子今日到沙田出席演唱會記者會公布演唱會詳情。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/10eed5ca56b11c4d464aba323657a37d/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-28_at_2_45_02_PM.jpeg\"/><img alt=\" 12子「曬冷」式現身！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/f9d1351caa029a00639ca46435f331fd/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-28_at_2_45_05_PM.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"MIRROR到達活動場地時即惹來全場鏡粉瘋狂尖叫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/5f4a1ede9fcf103a085d2e033f4928be/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-28_at_2_40_40_PM_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"MIRROR將在12月11-13日、15-18日、20日共8埸「MIRROR 12 AS 1 LIVE 2026」假亞博ARENA舉行。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/e8a8faff64513dbb25412c880b6c064e/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-28_at_2_40_40_PM.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場吸引過千鏡粉帶同應援物到場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/79c4f797b80f51a6a6db391b9aa3a911/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-28_at_2_45_07_PM.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"神徒 \" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/5be8fbbada090dacc04ee6f182e5c2c1/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-28_at_2_45_08_PM.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"迫爆兩層商場！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/784474b95a461e27a62bd574c59a66cc/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-28_at_2_45_09_PM.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"Hellosss \" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/664806ef16001e5cc7a1f478cb1d4093/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-28_at_2_45_05_PM_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"爵屎\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/bc2fe34ddbcd066c98868b155b763fde/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-28_at_2_45_07_PM_1_.jpeg\"/><h2>12子「曬冷」式現身</h2><p>12子今日「曬冷」式現身，到達活動場地時即惹來全場鏡粉瘋狂尖叫，會上宣布MIRROR將在12月11-13日、15-18日、20日共8埸「MIRROR 12 AS 1 LIVE 2026」假亞博ARENA舉行。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-28T07:19:13.346198+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":293,"images":10,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}